contribution mezzanine(mezzanine) v1
description "A mezzanine floor adds 15 on the ground floor"
to "../site_capacity.rule" signature:db5e4557d7d786ef

inputs
  has_mezzanine(has_mezzanine) : bool

table from_mezzanine
policy unique
| has_mezzanine | floor       | -> mezzanine_extra : number |
| true          | ground      | 15                          |
| true          | not: ground | 0                           |
| false         | -           | 0                           |

into extra
  mezzanine_extra

examples
| has_shelving | has_racking | floor  | has_mezzanine | -> extra |
| true         | true        | ground | true          | 45       |
